secubox-toolbox (1.2.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Add PDF report generation via fpdf2 (pure-Python, lightweight).
    /report/{token} (HMAC) and /report/me (current client) endpoints now
    return application/pdf with session analysis : hash MAC, metrics,
    apps detected, compromise score, cert-pinned protected apps,
    inspected URLs, recommendations, retention policy.
  * Splash + success pages : add download link "Telecharger mon rapport PDF".
  * ca-init script : 0750 root:secubox-toolbox au lieu de 0700 root:root
    (fix permission denied sur lecture CA depuis API).
  * README.md complet : mission, architecture E2E, API routes, install,
    config, gardefous CSPN, sections rapport PDF, maintenance, WebUI.
  * Closes #477.

